# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository. The app is built and run on
# Linux (Docker, Render); CRLF in a shell-invoked config or script there is a
# classic "works on my machine" failure. Windows checkouts still work.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.dump binary
